prompt_template:
The current directory is a checkout of the abapGit repository (ABAP sources in abapGit file format under src/). List every method that calls {target}, defined in {defined_in}. Other classes and interfaces in the repository declare methods with the same name; calls to those are not calls of {target} and must not be listed. {count_rule} Calls made dynamically, with the method name in a literal or variable, do not count. Include callers in local classes and in unit test classes. For each call give the calling method, the file path relative to the repository root, and the 1-based line number of the call.

End your reply with a single JSON object and nothing after it:
{{"callers": [{{"method": "<class>-><method>", "file": "src/...", "line": 123}}]}}
